\newlabel{fig:og_cel_frac_curves}{{5}{15}{Mean performance and mean hyperparameter CV as a function of negative sign percentage for the empirical \textit {C.\ elegans} magnitude pattern after removing the original signs. IPC is denoted in orange, GR in red, MC in blue, and KR in green. Reintroducing inhibitory signs again traces the performance--invariance tradeoff, now with empirical magnitudes held in place. A total of 250 trials were performed for each fraction}{figure.5}{}}
